; The stress, first part. A rules word's phonemes (10 x code) go onto this machine's own pile (OUT at keep, back to
; INP at gy and gw), counting n, noting a vowel other than AX (hv). At its end (-13, or -14 for a function word) out go a
; header (-30, then 1 for a function word, else 0, then 1 for a word that isn't one with no vowel but AX, else 0),
; the phonemes (the last as -100
; less it, so the stress can tell IY at the word's end), and -20. Anything else on the pile (a finished word, or a part of a spelled one) goes on as it was, then the card
; that came after it.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-16: a phoneme onto the pile, or another card
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    TAC   neg
  06            keep    OUT   x
  07                    CLA   n
  08                    ADD   00
  09                    STO   n
  10                    CLA   x
  11                    SUB   c180
  12                    TAC   hv1
  13                    JMP   rec
  14            hv1     CLA   00
  15                    STO   hv
  16                    JMP   rec
  17            neg     ADD   c14      17-20: a rules word's end?
  18                    TAC   fl
  19                    SUB   n2
  20                    TAC   word
  21            fl      CLA   n        21-76: the pile as it was, then the card
  22                    SUB   00
  23                    TAC   flo
  24                    STO   n
  25            gy      INP   y
  26                    OUT   y
  27                    JMP   fl
  28            flo     OUT   x
  29                    JMP   rst
  30            word    OUT   m30      the header: -30, fn (a function word), ah (not one, and no vowel but AX); then the pile, -20
  31                    CLA   z
  32                    SUB   x
  33                    SUB   c13
  34                    STO   fn
  35                    OUT   fn
  36                    CLA   00
  37                    SUB   fn
  38                    SUB   hv
  39                    TAC   a0
  40                    JMP   ao
  41            a0      CLA   z
  42            ao      STO   h
  43                    OUT   h
  44            wl      CLA   n        the word's phonemes, the last as -100 - it
  45                    SUB   00
  46                    TAC   wo
  47                    STO   n
  48            gw      INP   y
  49                    SUB   00
  50                    TAC   lastp
  51                    OUT   y
  52                    JMP   wl
  53            lastp   CLA   z
  54                    SUB   y
  55                    SUB   c100
  56                    STO   y
  57                    OUT   y
  58            wo      OUT   m20
  59            rst     CLA   z
  60                    STO   n
  61                    STO   hv
  62                    JMP   rec
  63            x       DATA  0
  64            y       DATA  0
  65            n       DATA  0
  66            hv      DATA  0
  67            fn      DATA  0
  68            h       DATA  0
  69            z       DATA  0
  70            n2      DATA  2
  71            c13     DATA  13
  72            c14     DATA  14
  73            m30     DATA  -30
  74            c100    DATA  100
  75            c180    DATA  180
  76            m20     DATA  -20
